      "prompt": "A fair die is rolled. What's $P(\\text{even or greater than 4})$?",
      "choices": [
        "$2/3$",
        "$5/6$",
        "$1/2$",
        "$1/3$"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "why": "Even is 2, 4, 6 and greater than 4 is 5, 6. Together that's 2, 4, 5, 6: 4 of 6. Don't count 6 twice.",
